    <!-- ============ Changelog ============ -->
    <string name="changelog_v1_title">v1.0.0 · Stable release</string>
    <string name="changelog_v1_body">· Four guard levels (Normal / Accessibility / Shizuku / Root)\n· AI verdict engine with DeepSeek by default, 7 LLM providers supported\n· Scan Center: folder scan / full scan\n· Quarantine: quarantine · restore · allow management\n· API Key stored with Keystore encryption\n· Appearance themes (dark / light / follow system) and in-app language switching</string>
    <string name="changelog_v20_title">v2.0.0 · Stable release</string>
    <string name="changelog_v20_body">· Fixed crash when requesting notification permission after choosing a mode\n· App icon: centered four-pointed star, pure white background\n· Mode cards: removed level labels, line-style icons\n· Check for updates: GitHub Releases with CN mirror download</string>
    <string name="changelog_v22_title">v2.2.0 · Stable release</string>
    <string name="changelog_v22_body">· Guard logic: fixed deep guard not enabled in old versions; added ML model for auxiliary verdict\n· Virus database: updated built-in and full databases, switchable freely\n· AI verdict engine: supports 14 providers, custom providers allowed, added "Fetch model list" button\n· New Toolbox section: view app permissions, recent files and traffic management\n· New unified management screen: merges Activity, allowed files and quarantine into one place\n· UI: refined interaction and styling for mode selection, scan animation, side drawer, settings and theme switch; added landscape mode</string>
    <string name="changelog_v21_title">v2.1.0 · Stable release</string>
    <string name="changelog_v21_body">· Intercept notification: protection text + red turn-off + missing-permission prompt with grant\n· Fixed triple-volume-key emergency exit; direct uninstall to prevent revival\n· Fixed background guard persistence; usage access for foreground detection\n· Fixed version detection (no more false \"new version\")\n· Smoother animations; wave progress ball for update download\n· AI icon → server, Root icon → tilted key, star shrunk with margin\n· Expanded threat database\n· New \"App monitoring\" in Intercept: real-time abnormal behavior checks\n· New \"Activity\" tab: full protection log</string>
    <string name="changelog_v13_title">v1.3.0 · Stable release</string>
    <string name="changelog_v13_body">· New "Intercept" guard tab (red alert theme)\n· Real-time blocking of malicious lock-screen / screen takeover / notification theft / ransomware / usage-rights violations\n· Pinned system notification "Intercept mode on" when enabled, one-tap to turn off\n· Blocked apps managed centrally, with allow and delete\n· AI scan shows the full reasoning feedback</string>
    <string name="changelog_v09_title">v0.9.0 · Beta</string>
    <string name="changelog_v09_body">· Family-based malware signature library (~30 real families)\n· File-level heuristic scoring + AI verdict\n· Daily scheduled scans and guard-on-boot</string>

